Use the **nhsa-coding** skill — a query-and-validation protocol, not a code knowledge base. Generate codes by searching and validating via the NHSA MCP connector; never from memory.

## Output Format

每个编码必须附带出处（code_system / code_version / effective_date / retrieved_at / source / validation_status）：

```
主要诊断
  code: [code]
  code_system: 医保版ICD-10
  code_version: [version]
  effective_date: [date]
  retrieved_at: [timestamp]
  source: [connector]
  validation_status: valid|pending|unverifiable
```

## Notes

- Always verify codes with the MCP connector
- Never output codes from memory — errors are common
- Do not mix code systems: settlement-list operative codes are 医保版手术操作分类编码 (ICD-9-CM-3 based), not CCHI
